**command.hpp defines console command registration, argument access, and execution APIs.**

## Exports

`command::params()`; `size() const -> int`; `get(int) const -> const char*`; `join(int) const -> std::string`; `get_all() const -> std::vector<std::string>`; `operator[](int) const -> const char*`.

`add_raw(const char*, void(*)())`; `add(const char*, std::function<void(const params&)>)`; `add(const char*, std::function<void()>)`; `execute(std::string)`.

`params::nesting_` stores `DWORD` nesting state; requires `<string>`, `<vector>`, `<functional>`, and `DWORD` declarations.